      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability — removing unused fields, unused imports, and the unused helper method, while keeping all assertions identical.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version removes all unused fields (`BASE64_IMPOSSIBLE_CASES`, `SWISS_GERMAN_STUFF_UNICODE`, `RUSSIAN_STUFF_UNICODE`), the unused `constructString` helper method, and extraneous imports, while adding inline comments that explain the intent of each assertion — all without changing the methods called, arguments used, or expected outcomes."
